 # Aspose.Cells FOSS for Java
 
+[![Maven Central: org.aspose:aspose-cells-foss](https://img.shields.io/maven-central/v/org.aspose/aspose-cells-foss.svg?label=Maven%20Central)](https://central.sonatype.com/artifact/org.aspose/aspose-cells-foss) [![Version: 26.7.0](https://img.shields.io/badge/Version-26.7.0-blue)](https://central.sonatype.com/artifact/org.aspose/aspose-cells-foss) [![License: MIT](https://img.shields.io/badge/License-MIT-blue)](LICENSE)
+
 Aspose.Cells FOSS for Java is a Java 17 spreadsheet library for creating, loading, modifying, and saving Excel `.xlsx` workbooks.
 It exposes a user-facing API in `org.aspose.cells_foss` and keeps OOXML packaging, XML mapping, and XLSX serialization inside this repository.
 
+## At a glance
+
+- **For:** Developers using Java.
+- **Problem solved:** Cell values for strings, numbers, booleans, date/time values, and formulas. Defined names.
+- **Verified capabilities:** Cell values for strings, numbers, booleans, date/time values, and formulas. Defined names. Embedded charts with 21 standard chart types.
+- **Verified formats:** Load formats: AUTO, XLSX. Save format: XLSX.
+- **Runtime:** 17
+- **Current verified limitation:** ChartEx types (Waterfall, Treemap, Sunburst, Histogram, BoxAndWhisker, Funnel, Map) cannot be created programmatically; they are preserved verbatim across load/save.
+
